{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ordinary swordsman, Ethan, sets out to find an ordinary herb to save his sister, Elaine, on an extraordinary and perilous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a 2D top-down scrolling shoot'em up RPG. Take control of Ethan, slashing enemies with powerful sword waves across the main stages. Stay alert\u2014getting pushed off-screen means death! Each stage features interactive challenges to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/GamePlay.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cAdvice\u201d from the Witch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death isn\u2019t the end\u2014the Witch will revive Ethan and give some \u201cadvice&quot;. Is the advice helpful? Well\u2026It depends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/WitchAdvice_en.jpg?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ethan\u2019s sword waves vary with his equipping weapons. Most of the weapons can be obtained by crafting, but some are obtained through secret means. Two weapons can be equipped at once. Experiment with combos to master your fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/Weapon_Skill.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain ingredients in battle and craft useful stuffs at the Witch\u2019s oven. Crafting is like playing a puzzle: fitting ingredient blocks into specific shapes while meeting material and attribute requirements. Unlock recipes by clearing stages\u2014or uncover hidden ones through exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/Craft_en.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Herbs Planting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm will be unlocked after clearing the first stage. Put seeds there and adventure a few times, herbs will be harvested. Herbs will trigger  effects in battle, which make the adventure easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/Farm_en.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More to Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More riddles and funny elements are waiting to be discovered. Are you ready to conquer Ethan\u2019s adventure?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594040?t=1745063486","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3594040?t=1745063486","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/63493a79db5d0bd17f0a7c3717f8de52786d5a8b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745063486","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/63493a79db5d0bd17f0a7c3717f8de52786d5a8b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745063486","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An ordinary swordsman, Ethan, sets out to find an ordinary herb to save his sister, Elaine, on an extraordinary and perilous journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>About the Game</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This is a 2D top-down scrolling shoot'em up RPG. Take control of Ethan, slashing enemies with powerful sword waves across the main stages. Stay alert\u2014getting pushed off-screen means death! Each stage features interactive challenges to test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/GamePlay.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u201cAdvice\u201d from the Witch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Death isn\u2019t the end\u2014the Witch will revive Ethan and give some \u201cadvice&quot;. Is the advice helpful? Well\u2026It depends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/WitchAdvice_en.jpg?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Weapon Combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ethan\u2019s sword waves vary with his equipping weapons. Most of the weapons can be obtained by crafting, but some are obtained through secret means. Two weapons can be equipped at once. Experiment with combos to master your fighting style!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/Weapon_Skill.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Puzzle Crafting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obtain ingredients in battle and craft useful stuffs at the Witch\u2019s oven. Crafting is like playing a puzzle: fitting ingredient blocks into specific shapes while meeting material and attribute requirements. Unlock recipes by clearing stages\u2014or uncover hidden ones through exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/Craft_en.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Herbs Planting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Farm will be unlocked after clearing the first stage. Put seeds there and adventure a few times, herbs will be harvested. Herbs will trigger  effects in battle, which make the adventure easier.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/extras/Farm_en.gif?t=1745063486\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>More to Discover</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More riddles and funny elements are waiting to be discovered. Are you ready to conquer Ethan\u2019s adventure?</p>","developers":["Sparrow Ball Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594040/61dd8c016e43859515d96d83b44ec75fe698cdea/header.jpg?t=1745063486","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257113939,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113939/movie480.mp4?t=1744206293","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113939/movie_max.mp4?t=1744206293"},"name":"TrailerEN","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257113939/0d1a9e86cf2c93198476420429c50e999d09253a/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1744206293","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113939/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1744206293","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257113939/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1744206293"}}],"name":"Herb Seek Slash","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br>